<section id="S3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">3.2 </span>Analysis of Therapeutic Quality</h3>

<div id="S3.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S3.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">A summary of descriptive statistics and the distribution of scores for each model are presented in Table <a href="#S3.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ 3.2 Analysis of Therapeutic Quality ‣ 3 Results ‣ The Thinking Therapist: Training Large Language Models to Deliver Acceptance and Commitment Therapy using Supervised Fine-Tuning and Odds Ratio Policy Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> and Figure <a href="#S3.F1" title="Figure 1 ‣ 3.2 Analysis of Therapeutic Quality ‣ 3 Results ‣ The Thinking Therapist: Training Large Language Models to Deliver Acceptance and Commitment Therapy using Supervised Fine-Tuning and Odds Ratio Policy Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, respectively. To facilitate interpretation, Table <a href="#S3.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ 3.2 Analysis of Therapeutic Quality ‣ 3 Results ‣ The Thinking Therapist: Training Large Language Models to Deliver Acceptance and Commitment Therapy using Supervised Fine-Tuning and Odds Ratio Policy Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> reports estimated marginal means from the mixed-effects models for each variant, along with differences versus Instruct (COT), 95% confidence intervals, standardized effect sizes (Hedges <math id="S3.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="g" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>g</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">g</annotation></semantics></math>), and Holm-Sidak adjusted <math id="S3.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math>-values for both outcomes.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S3.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Descriptive Statistics for Primary Outcome Measures by Model Type.</figcaption>
<table id="S3.T2.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S3.T2.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S3.T2.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><span id="S3.T2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model Variant</span></th>
<th id="S3.T2.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><span id="S3.T2.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">N</span></th>
<th id="S3.T2.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="S3.T2.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ACT-FM Total (Mean (SD))</span></th>
<th id="S3.T2.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="S3.T2.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">TES Mean (Mean (SD))</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S3.T2.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S3.T2.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t">Instruct (COT)</th>
